          "correctFeedback": "Correct. Oxidation: Hg(l) + S 2- (aq) → 2 e - + HgS(s) E° = -0.70 V Reduction: 2 Ag + (aq) + 2 e - → 2 Ag(s) E° = +0.7996 V E c ell° = E c athode° - E a node° E c ell° = +0.7996 V - (-0.70 V) = 1.50 V Correct. Oxidation: Hg(l) + S 2- (aq) → Ag(s) + HgS(s) Reduction: 2 Ag + (aq) + 2 e - → 2 Ag(s) Overall: Hg(l) + S 2- (aq) + 2 Ag + (aq) → 2 Ag(s) + HgS(s) Q = \\lbrackproducts\\rbrack \\lbrackreactants\\rbrack = 1 2- + 2 Q = 1(0.10 M)(0.25 M) 2 E cell = E c ell° - 0.0592 Vn log Q E cell = 1.5 - 0.0592 V2 log 1(0.10)(0.25) 2 = 1.43 V",
