          "correctFeedback": "Correct. Cu( s ) loses electrons (its oxidation state increases from 0 to +2), so it is oxidized. Correct. Cu( s ) reacts to form Cu 2+ ( aq ). Correct. H 2 SO 3 ( aq ) gains electrons (the oxidation state for S decreases from +4 to 0), so it is reduced. Correct. H 2 SO 3 ( a ) reacts to form S( s ).",
